00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:57.900
and I did all my undergrad
studies in Istanbul, in Turkey.

00:01:58.020 --> 00:02:00.960
And I become interested in science,

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:02.650
I guess in middle school,

00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:05.090
but mostly in high school.

00:02:05.090 --> 00:02:08.170
I always enjoy my biology classes.

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:11.870
And in middle school
like my science teacher,

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:12.893
he was great.

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:17.850
