00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:19.653
such as, this a gel tank.

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:24.290
This is we use to run agarose gel.

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:29.290
And agarose gel is basically a gel

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:31.493
we use to separate DNA.

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:37.570
So this is how my bench spaces look like.

00:14:37.570 --> 00:14:40.250
And today, I will not be wearing lab coat,

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:42.610
