00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:47.773
because I will be touching my bench.

00:14:49.614 --> 00:14:50.640
And my laboratory,

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:55.483
we are here working on
something called stem cells.

00:14:56.730 --> 00:15:00.150
And before kind of introducing stem cells,

00:15:00.150 --> 00:15:03.580
I want to first a little
bit talk about what cell is.

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:05.580
And one of my favorite thing to do

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:07.190
