00:34:01.950 --> 00:34:03.040
it has depth,

00:34:03.040 --> 00:34:04.090
and it has a breadth.

00:34:05.160 --> 00:34:07.320
And you can image an apple

00:34:07.320 --> 00:34:11.390
as it is in a more
three dimensional space.

00:34:11.390 --> 00:34:13.787
And the other way what you can do is

00:34:13.787 --> 00:34:17.070
you can make a very thin slices of apple.

00:34:17.070 --> 00:34:20.960
And this is basically saying
you can image the whole tissue

00:34:20.960 --> 00:34:23.597
as more in a three dimensional form

00:34:26.500 --> 00:34:28.580
or you can make a very thin slice,

00:34:28.580 --> 00:34:30.620
so it's what we call a section,

00:34:30.620 --> 00:34:35.370
an image more in a two dimensional form.

00:34:35.370 --> 00:34:38.670
And today, we will look
more two dimensional images.

